WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:01.863
The future speaks in data.

00:00:01.863 --> 00:00:03.727
We anticipate it with decisions.

00:00:03.727 --> 00:00:07.058
FastAnalytics is research, science and technology.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:22.530
We are a platform that unites mathematical modeling, data analytics and artificial intelligence in a single flow, to anticipate security threats, organized crime, money laundering and disaster risks.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:24.840
First, the data line.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:30.459
The territory reports through every channel, with facial and license plate recognition built in.

00:00:30.459 --> 00:00:36.330
Eyes on every phone and on existing video surveillance cameras, anonymously and even offline.

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:40.652
With that data, the analysis line springs into action.

00:00:40.652 --> 00:00:49.048
Artificial intelligence and analyst judgment turn evidence into information worth deciding on, in seconds, not weeks.

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:51.003
Then, the command line.

00:00:51.003 --> 00:00:56.937
Organizations coordinate the response on a single board, with real-time reports and traceability.

00:00:56.937 --> 00:00:58.791
Everyone notified, everyone active.

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:02.904
And the anticipation line closes the cycle.

00:01:02.904 --> 00:01:09.350
The Decisional Nonagon turns the weak signal into tomorrow's decision, every day and in every crisis.

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:22.370
Less impact on your people on the ground, media management, reputation protection and immediate information for your decision makers, every day and in crisis.

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:31.993
With CeciTeaches, everything learned stays available twenty-four seven, for any question about the platform or the technical side.

00:01:33.370 --> 00:01:35.364
This already happened, and it has a method.

00:01:35.364 --> 00:01:40.300
Twenty twenty-one, homicide, univariate outlier detection.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:45.304
Ibagué twenty twenty-two, several crimes, non-parametric spatio-temporal statistical models.

00:01:45.304 --> 00:01:51.027
December twenty twenty-four, several crimes, multivariate outliers.

00:01:58.650 --> 00:01:59.475
FastAnalytics.

00:01:59.475 --> 00:02:00.950
Book a demonstration.
